<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopia and Sudan are accusing each other of supporting armed groups, while clashes along the Afar Somali border have intensified, causing civilian harm. The fighting in southern Ethiopia has displaced around 700,000 people and spilled into Kenya, prompting a UK travel warning for Moyale and a Senate foreign relations chairman warning of Christians being killed. A U.S. legislator has proposed tying trade incentives to peace with Ethiopia and Eritrea, and over 200 Tigrayan fighters have surrendered to the Ethiopian army amid Eritrean tensions. The conflict produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNenl3MEtPQjFubVRadEhNS29ZTEcyeFpVTWNNMmt1dzJwMmJ2MWtIbXFFaWxrWno5dUJUczNHSjNIR0otdEU0Z3hwN2pOckE4bFJiU2RQRnBfTXItQ19jZmtlVV9qZ2tJenVXN1phNlVWRTNsYjZISDF1amlFaDJOeENNM3p2UEg2UjJlemNQU1kzUHdjV2NOdjUtRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNLW1GamUzSk1HMXM1a25uMUM2Unhsem4ydjdabWI3YmZuWHpMLVBaZ3BnWURZUXVTWVpHUFdMWUV3TzJQS3VGUmNPaDAzRkdzUHBXXzByaGhKX2N3cmV2YUEyZ1lMNHo5VUVWanpJS1pqZlZ1YmlEcFY1X2k3dmUxNE5yQWtrbkNPdXg2NVQxNU5hV0syU3JKeFJkQThPWGlaWXJYMi1kNnpqdWFLblBIOXFvVGZpMzNqeGcwTFV1ZFpSdS0xV0ozVW1VSlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOZkxUSVFGY0MyM0tYMkUtbkNpajFtdVJfY0NmSnhTMEE1Y3V6MlgtcWtPaVQxdFVIWTNPYzlEbFdWblBuTjd1Q1dfSTVDemc3ajdvbG5QQjRzSDVYa1NpbEZuWUJGbFlvUFJjdGNSMmZtcUtJUVFpeEdEU0s2RzctaE14T3M3OXFJbHRUdW44SXUySzZQemdsNV96UlV4WlV6?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/